       2000-LLAMADA-MODULO.
      ****************
           INITIALIZE WS-KPETINFORME

           PERFORM 2010-CONSULTAR-AGENDA

           INITIALIZE WS-X372M006

           SET NO-ESCRITURA TO TRUE

           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-FECHA-SIS.

           MOVE WS-ANO                   TO CB-INTRO-ANO
           MOVE WS-MES                   TO CB-INTRO-MES
           MOVE WS-DIA                   TO CB-INTRO-DIA

           MOVE ZEROES TO XN-I
           MOVE 'S'                      TO X372M006-SPAGINACION-S

           PERFORM UNTIL X372M006-NUM-REGISTROS-S  > CN-RES-MAX
                      OR X372M006-SPAGINACION-S = 'N'
                      OR XN-I > CN-RES-MAX
                      OR XN-I > X372M006-NUM-REGISTROS-S
                      OR ERROR-GRAVE

             PERFORM 2100-MOVER-ENTRADA-LISTADO

             CALL WS-B372M006 USING WS-X372M006

             IF X372M006-CRETORNO-S  = '00'                                ROES
                PERFORM 2200-ESCRIBIR-LINEA
             ELSE
                IF X372M006-CRETORNO-S NOT = '03'
                   SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE
                   SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 2031-ERR-MODULO-CONSULTA
                END-IF
             END-IF

           END-PERFORM

           IF NO-ERROR
              PERFORM 2020-ACTUALIZAR-AGENDA
           END-IF

           IF NO-ERROR AND NO-ESCRITURA
                PERFORM 2099-ERR-NO-REG-ENCONTRADOS
           END-IF
            .

