              MOVE X362M007-KPETINFORME-S TO WS-KPETINFORME

           ELSE
              IF X362M007-CRETORNO-S EQUAL '03'
                 SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
                 PERFORM 2012-ERR-FALTA-PETICIONES

                 ELSE
                    SET SI-ROLLBACK TO TRUE
                    SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE
                    PERFORM 2011-ERR-CONSULTAR-INFORME
