       2200-ESCRIBIR-LINEA.
      ***************************************************************

           PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1
                     UNTIL XN-J > X372M006-NUM-REGISTROS-S
                        OR XN-J > CN-RES-MAX

           PERFORM 2005-CONSULTAR-CENTIDAD

             IF X372M006-CENTIDAD-S(XN-J) NOT EQUAL WS-ANT-CENTIDAD
                MOVE X372M006-CENTIDAD-S(XN-J) TO WS-ANT-CENTIDAD
                IF SW-SI-PRIMERA-VEZ
                   SET SW-NO-PRIMERA-VEZ TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 8100-CABECERA-BUZON
                ELSE
      *            PERFORM 2300-MOVER-TOTALES
      *            PERFORM 2400-IMPRIMIR-TOTALES
                   PERFORM 8100-CABECERA-BUZON
                   MOVE 1 TO CT-PAGE
                   MOVE 1 TO CT-LINEA
                   PERFORM 2210-IMPRIMIR-INTRO
                   PERFORM 2220-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-1
                   PERFORM 2230-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-2
      *            INITIALIZE TOTALES LIN-DETALLE-TOTAL
                END-IF
             END-IF

              MOVE X372M006-ANIO-S           (XN-J)TO DE-ANIO
              MOVE X372M006-KEXPEDIENTE-S    (XN-J)TO DE-EXPED
              MOVE X372M006-KRAMO-S          (XN-J)TO DE-RAMO
              MOVE X372M006-ANIOPOL-S        (XN-J)(3:2) TO DE-ANIOPOL
              MOVE X372M006-KPOLIZA-S        (XN-J)TO DE-POLIZA

              IF CT-LINEA EQUAL 0 OR CT-LINEA > 58
                 PERFORM 2210-IMPRIMIR-INTRO
                 PERFORM 2220-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-1
                 PERFORM 2230-IMPRIMIR-TITULOS-2
                 ADD 1 TO CT-PAGE
                 MOVE -1 TO CT-LINEA
              END-IF

      * IMPRIMIR-LINEA-DETALLE.

              MOVE LIN-DETALLE TO RIMPRESO
              WRITE RIMPRESO AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINE
              ADD   1  TO  CT-LINEA

